@startuml F5.5-D05-atrasados-csv
title F5.5-D05 — Atrasados com exportação CSV
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: /secretaria/atrasados
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /requests?slaBreached=true
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT atrasadas
Postgres --> WebApp: 200 lista
Sec -> WebApp: Exportar
WebApp -> Jwt: GET ?format=csv
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT página
Postgres --> Ctrl: rows
Ctrl --> WebApp: CSV attachment\n(UTF-8 BOM)
WebApp --> Sec: download CSV

@enduml
